Sources
-------
  KEYCLICK.ASM    CP/M-80, 8080 instructions only: ASM KEYCLICK, LOAD KEYCLICK
  KEYCLICK.A86    CP/M-86, MASM syntax, program from 100h; MKCMD.PY
                  puts the CMD header (8080 memory model) in front
  KEYCLICK.S      CP/M-68K, GNU as (m68k-linux-gnu-as -m68000
                  --register-prefix-optional); position independent,
                  MK68K.PY puts the program header (601Ah) in front
